## QUICK REFERENCE: USE EACH FILE FOR...

**Understanding the big picture:**
→ PORTFOLIO-OPERATING-SYSTEM-BLUEPRINT.md (start here)

**Making decisions about which ventures to scale:**
→ PORTFOLIO-OPERATING-SYSTEM-BLUEPRINT.md (health scoring rules)
→ ventures-master.csv (current data)

**Understanding business models:**
→ venture-hub/CLAUDE.md (revenue models, unit economics)

**Seeing all ventures:**
→ ventures-master.csv (complete list)
→ ventures-by-sector.csv (organized)

**Seeing all repos you own:**
→ MASTER-REPO-REGISTRY.csv (985 repos)

**Finding what capabilities you need:**
→ ventures_with_capabilities.csv (what ventures need)
→ CAPABILITIES-INVENTORY.csv (summary)

**Understanding execution status:**
→ MASTER-TASKS.md (what's being done)
→ COMPLETION-PHASES-ROADMAP.md (timeline)

**Querying analytics:**
→ worldwidebro_os.duckdb (SQL queries)
→ KNOWLEDGE-GRAPH-DASHBOARD.md (Obsidian visualization)

**Setting up infrastructure:**
→ OPERATING_SYSTEM_SETUP.md
→ operating_system_schema.sql

**Building new ventures:**
→ OPERATING_SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE.md (component-based approach)
→ venture-hub/CLAUDE.md (business model templates)

