## KEY FILES YOU'LL USE MOST

**Every Monday:**
1. ventures-master.csv (check status)
2. PORTFOLIO-OPERATING-SYSTEM-BLUEPRINT.md (decision rules)
3. MASTER-TASKS.md (what to do)

**Every Month:**
1. Run populate_venture_knowledge_graph.py
2. Run obsidian_graph_sync.py
3. Query worldwidebro_os.duckdb
4. Update ventures-master.csv

**Every Quarter:**
1. Health score all 687 ventures (using PORTFOLIO-OPERATING-SYSTEM-BLUEPRINT.md)
2. Kill bottom 10%
3. Reallocate capital to top 20%
4. Update COMPLETION-PHASES-ROADMAP.md

